#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to do common tasks, from install and authentication to checking job status and fetching error messages"
msgstr "Cara melakukan tugas biasa, daripada pemasangan dan pengesahan sehingga menyemak status kerja dan mendapatkan mesej ralat"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up functions"
msgstr "Sediakan fungsi"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"guides/functions-get-started.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore Jarman, HIVQE, Cadavid, Chandarana, Leclerc, Sachdeva, HUBO, Filippov, Downfolding, Aharonov, Mundada, Yamauchi, supersymmetric, Paterakis, Gharibyan, Jaffali, Pellow */}\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Premium, Flex, and On-Prem (through the IBM Quantum&reg; Platform API) Plan users can [get started with select functions](#pay-per-execution) hosted in the IBM Quantum Functions Catalog immediately by enabling them in instance settings. Alternatively, [request a free trial](#trial) or [procure a license](#license) from the contributing third-party partner.\n"
msgstr "Pengguna Plan Premium, Flex, dan On-Prem (melalui IBM Quantum&reg; Platform API) boleh [bermula dengan fungsi terpilih](#pay-per-execution) yang dihoskan dalam IBM Quantum Functions Catalog dengan segera dengan mendayakannya dalam tetapan instance. Sebagai alternatif, [minta percubaan percuma](#trial) atau [dapatkan lesen](#license) daripada rakan kongsi pihak ketiga yang menyumbang.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"pay-per-execution\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pay per execution {#pay-per-execution}"
msgstr "Bayar mengikut pelaksanaan {#pay-per-execution}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can enable access to available functions per-instance within instance settings (see the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page). View the cost per execution by function in the [Overview of available functions](/guides/functions#overview-of-available-functions) table.\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh mendayakan akses kepada fungsi yang tersedia bagi setiap instance dalam tetapan instance (lihat halaman [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances)). Lihat kos bagi setiap pelaksanaan mengikut fungsi dalam jadual [Gambaran keseluruhan fungsi yang tersedia](/guides/functions#overview-of-available-functions).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"trial\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Request a free trial for third-party quantum functions {#request-a-free-trial-for-third-party-quantum-functions}"
msgstr "Minta percubaan percuma untuk fungsi kuantum pihak ketiga {#request-a-free-trial-for-third-party-quantum-functions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To request a free trial, navigate to the [IBM Quantum Functions Catalog](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions), and explore the details panel. Click `Request a free trial` and fill out information required by the functions partner, including your IBM Cloud account ID:\n"
msgstr "Untuk meminta percubaan percuma, navigasi ke [Katalog Fungsi IBM Quantum](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions), dan terokai panel butiran. Klik `Request a free trial` dan isi maklumat yang diperlukan oleh rakan kongsi fungsi, termasuk ID akaun IBM Cloud anda:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Navigate to [Account settings](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/account) and log in if you haven't already\n"
msgstr "Navigasi ke [Tetapan akaun](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/account) dan log masuk jika anda belum berbuat demikian\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verify eligibility.\n"
msgstr "Sahkan kelayakan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Switch your account in the menu bar on the header to one with the following format: `XXXXXXX - [Organization Name]`\n"
msgstr "Tukar akaun anda dalam bar menu pada header kepada satu dengan format berikut: `XXXXXXX - [Organization Name]`\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ensure the organization is the same as the one associated with your Premium account.\n"
msgstr "Pastikan organisasi adalah sama dengan yang berkaitan dengan akaun Premium anda.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you see \"[Your Name]'s Account\", you are using your _personal_ account, which is not eligible for premium access.\n"
msgstr "Jika anda melihat \"[Your Name]'s Account\", anda menggunakan akaun _peribadi_ anda, yang tidak layak untuk akses premium.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find your account ID under  **Account ID**. It is a 32-character unique identifier.\n"
msgstr "Cari ID akaun anda di bawah  **Account ID**. Ia ialah pengecam unik yang terdiri daripada 32 aksara.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"license\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procure a license {#procure-a-license}"
msgstr "Dapatkan lesen {#procure-a-license}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To purchase a license for a function, locate the function in the [Overview of functions](/guides/functions#overview-of-available-functions) table and click the Guide link. Find contact information for the third-party vendor in the **Get support** section of the function's guide.\n"
msgstr "Untuk membeli lesen bagi sesuatu fungsi, cari fungsi tersebut dalam jadual [Gambaran keseluruhan fungsi](/guides/functions#overview-of-available-functions) dan klik pautan Panduan. Cari maklumat hubungan vendor pihak ketiga dalam bahagian **Get support** pada panduan fungsi tersebut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"install-qiskit-functions-catalog-client\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the IBM Quantum Functions Catalog client {#install-the-ibm-quantum-functions-catalog-client}"
msgstr "Pasang klien IBM Quantum Functions Catalog {#install-the-ibm-quantum-functions-catalog-client}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "To start using functions, install the IBM Quantum Functions Catalog client:\n"
msgstr "Untuk mula menggunakan fungsi, pasang klien IBM Quantum Functions Catalog:\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-29
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retrieve your API key from the [IBM Quantum Platform dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), and activate your Python virtual environment.  See the [installation instructions](/guides/install-qiskit#local) if you do not already have a virtual environment set up.\n"
msgstr "Ambil kunci API anda daripada [papan pemuka IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), dan aktifkan persekitaran maya Python anda. Lihat [arahan pemasangan](/guides/install-qiskit#local) jika anda belum mempunyai persekitaran maya yang disediakan.\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   <span id=\"save-account\"></span>**If you are working in a trusted Python environment (such as on a personal laptop or workstation),** use the `save_account()` method to save your credentials locally. ([Skip to the next step](#functions-untrusted) if you are not using a trusted environment, such as a shared or public computer, to authenticate to IBM Quantum Platform.)\n"
msgstr "   <span id=\"save-account\"></span>**Jika anda bekerja dalam persekitaran Python yang dipercayai (seperti di laptop atau stesen kerja peribadi),** guna kaedah `save_account()` untuk menyimpan bukti kelayakan anda secara tempatan. ([Langkau ke langkah seterusnya](#functions-untrusted) jika anda tidak menggunakan persekitaran yang dipercayai, seperti komputer awam atau dikongsi, untuk mengesahkan diri ke IBM Quantum Platform.)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   The instance you authenticate with must have functions access enabled. To configure it on an existing instance, see [Configure access on an instance](/guides/access-instances-platform-apis#functions-api).\n"
msgstr "   Instance yang anda gunakan untuk pengesahan mestilah mempunyai akses fungsi yang didayakan. Untuk mengonfigurasikannya pada instance sedia ada, lihat [Konfigurasikan akses pada instance](/guides/access-instances-platform-apis#functions-api).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   To use `save_account()`, run `python` in your shell, then enter the following:\n"
msgstr "   Untuk menggunakan `save_account()`, jalankan `python` dalam shell anda, kemudian masukkan yang berikut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   Type `exit()`. From now on, whenever you need to authenticate to the service, you can load your credentials with the following:\n"
msgstr "   Taip `exit()`. Mulai sekarang, apabila anda perlu mengesahkan diri ke perkhidmatan, anda boleh memuatkan kelayakan anda dengan yang berikut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   For example:\n"
msgstr "   Contohnya:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"functions-untrusted\"></span>**Avoid executing code on an untrusted machine or an external cloud Python environment to minimize security risks.** If you must use an untrusted environment (on, for example, a public computer), change your API key after each use by deleting it on the [IBM Cloud API keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys) page to reduce risk. Learn more in the [Managing user API keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-userapikey&interface=ui) topic. To initialize the service in this situation, use this code:\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"functions-untrusted\"></span>**Elakkan menjalankan kod pada mesin yang tidak dipercayai atau persekitaran Python awan luaran untuk meminimumkan risiko keselamatan.** Jika anda perlu menggunakan persekitaran yang tidak dipercayai (contohnya, pada komputer awam), tukar kunci API anda selepas setiap penggunaan dengan memadamkannya di halaman [IBM Cloud API keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys) untuk mengurangkan risiko. Ketahui lebih lanjut dalam topik [Managing user API keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-userapikey&interface=ui). Untuk memulakan perkhidmatan dalam situasi ini, guna kod ini:\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"danger\" title=\"Protect your API key\">\n"
"**Never include your key in source code, Python scripts, or notebook files.** When sharing code with others, ensure that your API key is not embedded directly within the Python script. Instead, share the script without the key and provide instructions for securely setting it up.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"danger\" title=\"Lindungi kunci API anda\">\n"
"**Jangan sekali-kali sertakan kunci anda dalam kod sumber, skrip Python, atau fail notebook.** Apabila berkongsi kod dengan orang lain, pastikan kunci API anda tidak dibenamkan terus dalam skrip Python. Sebaliknya, kongsikan skrip tanpa kunci dan berikan arahan untuk menyediakannya dengan selamat.\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you accidentally share your key with someone or include it in version control like Git, immediately revoke your key by deleting it on the [IBM Cloud API keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys) page to reduce risk. Learn more in the [Managing user API keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-userapikey&interface=ui) topic.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika anda secara tidak sengaja berkongsi kunci anda dengan seseorang atau menyertakannya dalam kawalan versi seperti Git, segera batalkan kunci anda dengan memadamkannya pada halaman [IBM Cloud API keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys) untuk mengurangkan risiko. Ketahui lebih lanjut dalam topik [Managing user API keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-userapikey&interface=ui).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "List the functions you can access {#list-the-functions-you-can-access}"
msgstr "Senaraikan fungsi yang boleh anda akses {#list-the-functions-you-can-access}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After you authenticate, you can list the functions from the IBM Quantum Functions Catalog that you have access to:\n"
msgstr "Selepas anda mengesahkan diri, anda boleh menyenaraikan fungsi daripada Katalog Fungsi IBM Quantum yang boleh anda akses:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run enabled functions {#run-enabled-functions}"
msgstr "Jalankan fungsi yang didayakan {#run-enabled-functions}"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After a catalog object has been instantiated, you can select a function by using `catalog.load(\"<provider/function-name>\")`:\n"
msgstr "Selepas objek katalog dicipta, anda boleh memilih fungsi dengan menggunakan `catalog.load(\"<provider/function-name>\")`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each function has custom inputs, options, and outputs. Check the specific documentation pages for the function you want to run for more information. By default, all users can only run one function job at a time:\n"
msgstr "Setiap fungsi mempunyai input, pilihan, dan output tersendiri. Semak halaman dokumentasi khusus untuk fungsi yang ingin anda jalankan untuk maklumat lanjut. Secara lalai, semua pengguna hanya boleh menjalankan satu kerja fungsi pada satu masa:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`run()` checks your remaining capacity and backend access before it submits the job. If your instance is out of capacity, or the backend you named is not accessible, `run()` raises an error right away instead of leaving the job to fail in the queue. When capacity is low, `run()` emits a warning. Pass `suppress_low_usage_warning=True` to silence it.\n"
msgstr "`run()` menyemak kapasiti baki anda dan akses backend sebelum ia menghantar kerja. Jika instance anda kehabisan kapasiti, atau backend yang anda namakan tidak boleh diakses, `run()` menimbulkan ralat serta-merta dan bukannya membiarkan kerja itu gagal dalam baris gilir. Apabila kapasiti rendah, `run()` mengeluarkan amaran. Hantar `suppress_low_usage_warning=True` untuk membisukannya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"check-job-status\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check job status {#check-job-status}"
msgstr "Semak status kerja {#check-job-status}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "With your function `job_id`, you can check the status of running jobs. This includes the following statuses:\n"
msgstr "Dengan `job_id` fungsi anda, anda boleh menyemak status kerja yang sedang berjalan. Ini termasuk status berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`QUEUED`**: The remote program is in the function queue. The queue priority is based on how much you've used functions.\n"
msgstr "**`QUEUED`**: Program jauh berada dalam baris gilir fungsi. Keutamaan baris gilir adalah berdasarkan berapa banyak anda telah menggunakan fungsi.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`INITIALIZING`**: The remote program is starting; this includes setting up the remote environment and installing dependencies.\n"
msgstr "**`INITIALIZING`**: Program jauh sedang dimulakan; ini termasuk menyediakan persekitaran jauh dan memasang kebergantungan.\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`RUNNING`**: The program is running. This also includes several more detailed statuses if supported by specific Functions.\n"
msgstr "**`RUNNING`**: Program sedang berjalan. Ini juga termasuk beberapa status yang lebih terperinci jika disokong oleh fungsi tertentu.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`RUNNING: MAPPING`**: The function is currently mapping your classical inputs to quantum inputs.\n"
msgstr "**`RUNNING: MAPPING`**: Fungsi sedang memetakan input klasik anda kepada input kuantum.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`RUNNING: OPTIMIZING_FOR_HARDWARE`**: The function is optimizing for the selected QPU. This could include circuit transpilation, QPU characterization, observable backpropagation, and so forth.\n"
msgstr "**`RUNNING: OPTIMIZING_FOR_HARDWARE`**: Fungsi sedang mengoptimumkan untuk QPU yang dipilih. Ini boleh termasuk transpilasi litar, pencirian QPU, perambatan balik cerapan, dan sebagainya.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`RUNNING: WAITING_FOR_QPU`**: The function has submitted a job to IBM Quantum Compute Service, and is waiting in the queue.\n"
msgstr "**`RUNNING: WAITING_FOR_QPU`**: Fungsi telah menghantar kerja ke IBM Quantum Compute Service, dan sedang menunggu dalam baris gilir.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`RUNNING: EXECUTING_QPU`**: The function has an active Quantum Compute job.\n"
msgstr "**`RUNNING: EXECUTING_QPU`**: Fungsi mempunyai kerja Quantum Compute yang aktif.\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-29
#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`RUNNING: POST_PROCESSING`**: The function is post-processing results, which can include error mitigation, mapping quantum results to classical, and so forth.\n"
msgstr "**`RUNNING: POST_PROCESSING`**: Fungsi sedang melakukan pasca-pemprosesan keputusan, yang boleh termasuk mitigasi ralat, pemetaan keputusan kuantum kepada klasik, dan sebagainya.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`DONE`**: The program is complete, and you can retrieve result data with `job.result()`.\n"
msgstr "**`DONE`**: Program telah selesai, dan anda boleh mengambil data keputusan dengan `job.result()`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`ERROR`**: The program stopped running because of a problem. Use `job.result()` to get the error message.\n"
msgstr "**`ERROR`**: Program berhenti berjalan kerana masalah. Gunakan `job.result()` untuk mendapatkan mesej ralat.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`CANCELED`**: The program was canceled by a user, the service, or the server.\n"
msgstr "**`CANCELED`**: Program telah dibatalkan oleh pengguna, perkhidmatan, atau pelayan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"retrieve-results\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retrieve results {#retrieve-results}"
msgstr "Ambil keputusan {#retrieve-results}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After a program is `DONE`, you can use `job.result()` to fetch the result. This output format varies with each function, so be sure to follow the specific documentation:\n"
msgstr "Selepas program `DONE`, anda boleh menggunakan `job.result()` untuk mengambil keputusan. Format output ini berbeza-beza mengikut setiap fungsi, jadi pastikan anda mengikuti dokumentasi khusus:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also cancel a job at any time:\n"
msgstr "Anda juga boleh membatalkan kerja pada bila-bila masa:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Access the associated Quantum Compute jobs {#access-the-associated-quantum-compute-jobs}"
msgstr "Akses kerja Quantum Compute yang berkaitan {#access-the-associated-quantum-compute-jobs}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A function can submit one or more Quantum Compute jobs to a QPU while it runs. To retrieve the IDs of those runtime jobs, use `job.runtime_jobs()`. You can use these IDs to fetch the runtime job objects from a `QiskitRuntimeService` instance, or to find the workloads on the IBM Quantum Platform dashboard.\n"
msgstr "Fungsi boleh menghantar satu atau lebih kerja Quantum Compute ke QPU semasa ia berjalan. Untuk mengambil ID kerja masa jalan tersebut, gunakan `job.runtime_jobs()`. Anda boleh menggunakan ID ini untuk mengambil objek kerja masa jalan daripada instance `QiskitRuntimeService`, atau untuk mencari beban kerja pada papan pemuka IBM Quantum Platform.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If a function groups its runtime jobs into sessions or batches, use `job.runtime_sessions()` to list the session IDs. Pass one session ID to `job.runtime_jobs()` to return only the runtime jobs in that session:\n"
msgstr "Jika fungsi mengumpulkan kerja masa jalannya ke dalam sesi atau kelompok, gunakan `job.runtime_sessions()` untuk menyenaraikan ID sesi. Hantar satu ID sesi kepada `job.runtime_jobs()` untuk mengembalikan hanya kerja masa jalan dalam sesi tersebut:\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The returned list can be empty. A function reports its runtime jobs only when it submits them through the runtime service that the function receives at run time, and some functions do not submit runtime jobs directly.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Senarai yang dikembalikan boleh kosong. Fungsi hanya melaporkan kerja masa jalannya apabila ia menghantarnya melalui perkhidmatan masa jalan yang diterima oleh fungsi tersebut ketika ia dijalankan, dan sesetengah fungsi tidak menghantar kerja masa jalan secara langsung.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "View job logs {#view-job-logs}"
msgstr "Lihat log kerja {#view-job-logs}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use `job.logs()` to retrieve the log output that a function produces while it runs. Logs are useful for tracking progress and for debugging a job that ends in an `ERROR` state.\n"
msgstr "Gunakan `job.logs()` untuk mengambil output log yang dihasilkan oleh fungsi semasa ia berjalan. Log berguna untuk menjejaki kemajuan dan untuk menyahpepijat kerja yang berakhir dalam status `ERROR`.\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For a long-running job that produces many log lines, use `job.filtered_logs()` to return only the lines you want. Pass a regular expression to `include` to keep matching lines, or to `exclude` to drop matching lines:\n"
msgstr "Untuk kerja yang berjalan lama dan menghasilkan banyak baris log, gunakan `job.filtered_logs()` untuk mengembalikan hanya baris yang anda mahu. Hantar ungkapan nalar (regex) kepada `include` untuk mengekalkan baris yang sepadan, atau kepada `exclude` untuk membuang baris yang sepadan:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "List previously run functions jobs {#list-previously-run-functions-jobs}"
msgstr "Senaraikan kerja fungsi yang telah dijalankan sebelum ini {#list-previously-run-functions-jobs}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use `jobs()` to list all jobs submitted to functions:\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh menggunakan `jobs()` untuk menyenaraikan semua kerja yang dihantar ke fungsi:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To narrow the results, pass filters. Filter by function with `function`, by status with `status`, and by submission date with `created_after`. Page through results with `limit` and `offset`:\n"
msgstr "Untuk menyempitkan keputusan, hantar penapis. Tapis mengikut fungsi dengan `function`, mengikut status dengan `status`, dan mengikut tarikh penghantaran dengan `created_after`. Layari keputusan mengikut halaman dengan `limit` dan `offset`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you already have the job ID for a certain job, you can retrieve the job with `catalog.job()`:\n"
